# Accepted findings for the temporary demo environment (docs/aws.md "Security posture").
# AWS-0104 unrestricted egress: no NAT, the instance must reach ECR/Bedrock/SSM/S3 directly.
AWS-0104
# AWS-0164 public IP on the subnet: same reason; ingress is one port from one /32.
AWS-0164
# AWS-0132 / AWS-0095 customer-managed KMS keys for S3 / SNS: $1/key/month for a bucket of
# public docs and an alarm topic; SSE-S3 is used instead.
AWS-0132
AWS-0095
